96,northwest,"My plan is to navigate through the level, explore the environment, and reach the stairs down. I will start by searching for hidden doors and passages, and then move in the direction that seems most promising. I will also try to open any doors or passages that I find, and use my katana to kick any locked doors or enemies that I encounter. I will prioritize reaching the stairs down, as it seems to be the closest exit.

My reasoning is that the level is currently blocked in all directions by walls, but there may be hidden doors or passages that can be opened to create a new path. By searching and exploring, I can try to find these hidden passages and use them to move forward. I will also try to gather more information about the environment and the location of the stairs down, in order to make the most effective moves.

If I encounter a locked door, I will try to kick it open with my katana. If I encounter an enemy, I will try to defeat it with my katana. If I find a staircase down, I will try to climb down it to escape the level.","message:
